      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Overview</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          GameNightGPT is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          We collect minimal information:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 text-body">
          <li>Email addresses (only when you subscribe)</li>
          <li>Usage data collected through analytics cookies (see Analytics and Cookies below)</li>
          <li>Game rules questions (to improve our service)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Analytics and Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          We use Google Analytics, a web analytics service provided by Google LLC ("Google"), to understand how visitors find and use GameNightGPT so that we can improve it. Google Analytics is loaded on our site through Google Tag Manager.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          Google Analytics sets cookies and uses similar technologies to collect information about your visit, including the pages you view, how long you spend on them, the links you click, the site or search that referred you, and your browser, device type, and operating system. It also receives your IP address, which Google uses to estimate your general location; Google Analytics does not log or store full IP addresses.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          This information is sent to and stored by Google and is handled according to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:no-underline">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. We use it only in aggregate to understand overall usage patterns. We do not use it to identify you personally, and we do not combine it with your email address or any account information.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          You can opt out of Google Analytics at any time by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:no-underline">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>, or by blocking or deleting cookies in your browser settings. Blocking these cookies will not affect your ability to use GameNightGPT.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-heading mt-8 mb-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          We use your email address to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 text-body">
          <li>Provide access to GameNightGPT services</li>
          <li>Send product updates and newsletters (if subscribed)</li>
          <li>Communicate important service information</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          We will never sell your personal information. We only share data with service providers necessary to operate GameNightGPT (listed below). You can unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          We use industry-standard security measures to protect your data. Our service providers include:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 text-body">
          <li>Buttondown for newsletter and email management</li>
          <li>Langfuse and Rollbar for service quality and error monitoring</li>
          <li>Google Analytics and Google Tag Manager for website analytics</li>
          <li>Cloud infrastructure providers for hosting and data storage</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. Contact us at legal@gamenightgpt.com to exercise these rights.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-6">
          If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at legal@gamenightgpt.com.
        </p>
